   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:#333333\">It seens to be an simple server. </div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:#333333\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:#333333\">You will need to install R, shiny and packages in your server. Do you have access to do that?</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:#333333\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:#333333\">It might be easy to pay shinyapps io and link it in your website.</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
